{"voices": [{"id": "bm_george", "name": "The Veteran", "desc": "Warm, measured British broadcaster"}, {"id": "am_adam", "name": "Hype Host", "desc": "Energetic American host"}, {"id": "af_bella", "name": "Spark", "desc": "Bright, quick, playful"}, {"id": "am_michael", "name": "Coach", "desc": "Steady, confident analyst"}], "lines": [{"id": "L000001", "t_start": 1.504, "t_end": 4.96, "play_at": 9.692, "delay": 4.73, "text": "Good evening and welcome to Riverside Park for this evening's match.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [0.0, 3.53], "am_adam": [0.0, 3.45], "af_bella": [0.0, 3.67], "am_michael": [0.0, 3.78]}}, {"id": "L000002", "t_start": 5.6, "t_end": 9.088, "play_at": 13.445, "delay": 4.36, "text": "It's a lovely night for football and both sides need it once.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [3.78, 2.98], "am_adam": [3.7, 3.33], "af_bella": [3.92, 3.42], "am_michael": [4.03, 3.47]}}, {"id": "L000003", "t_start": 9.824, "t_end": 13.312, "play_at": 17.643, "delay": 4.33, "text": "Riverside Rovers get us underway, playing from left to right.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [7.01, 3.23], "am_adam": [7.28, 3.59], "af_bella": [7.59, 3.68], "am_michael": [7.75, 3.61]}}, {"id": "L000004", "t_start": 13.824, "t_end": 16.096, "play_at": 20.728, "delay": 3.98, "text": "Okafor finds Lindqvist on the halfway line.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [10.49, 2.58], "am_adam": [11.12, 2.55], "af_bella": [11.52, 2.57], "am_michael": [11.61, 2.62]}}, {"id": "L000005", "t_start": 16.864, "t_end": 21.472, "play_at": 27.136, "delay": 5.66, "text": "Lindqvist has been in fine form this season, always looking for the pass forward.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [13.32, 4.21], "am_adam": [13.92, 4.5], "af_bella": [14.34, 4.72], "am_michael": [14.48, 4.79]}}, {"id": "L000006", "t_start": 22.048, "t_end": 24.672, "play_at": 31.198, "delay": 4.38, "text": "Northgate United sit deep and wait for the press.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [17.78, 2.74], "am_adam": [18.67, 2.76], "af_bella": [19.31, 2.84], "am_michael": [19.52, 2.78]}}, {"id": "L000007", "t_start": 25.216, "t_end": 29.216, "play_at": 34.525, "delay": 5.31, "text": "Moreau steps in and wins it back cleanly. That's the kind of tackle the manager will love.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [20.77, 4.52], "am_adam": [21.68, 4.59], "af_bella": [22.4, 4.85], "am_michael": [22.55, 4.78]}}, {"id": "L000008", "t_start": 30.048, "t_end": 32.448, "play_at": 38.681, "delay": 4.4, "text": "Tanaka down the right wing past one past two.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [25.54, 2.66], "am_adam": [26.52, 2.51], "af_bella": [27.5, 2.46], "am_michael": [27.58, 2.56]}}, {"id": "L000009", "t_start": 32.896, "t_end": 34.336, "play_at": 41.074, "delay": 3.77, "text": "He cuts it back for Delgado.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [28.45, 1.56], "am_adam": [29.28, 1.54], "af_bella": [30.21, 1.51], "am_michael": [30.39, 1.55]}}, {"id": "L000010", "t_start": 34.656, "t_end": 35.136, "play_at": 42.519, "delay": 4.08, "text": "Oh what a chance.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "peak", "seg": {"bm_george": [30.26, 0.93], "am_adam": [31.07, 0.92], "af_bella": [31.97, 0.8], "am_michael": [32.19, 0.88]}}, {"id": "L000011", "t_start": 35.136, "t_end": 35.552, "play_at": 43.408, "delay": 4.77, "text": "Dance.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [31.44, 0.61], "am_adam": [32.24, 0.56], "af_bella": [33.02, 0.52], "am_michael": [33.32, 0.61]}}, {"id": "L000012", "t_start": 35.648, "t_end": 37.984, "play_at": 44.018, "delay": 4.87, "text": "He has to slow down, the goal is wide open.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [32.3, 2.26], "am_adam": [33.05, 2.3], "af_bella": [33.79, 2.42], "am_michael": [34.18, 2.47]}}, {"id": "L000013", "t_start": 38.784, "t_end": 41.12, "play_at": 46.098, "delay": 3.78, "text": "A goal kick then, and a lid off for Riverside.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [34.81, 2.47], "am_adam": [35.6, 2.45], "af_bella": [36.46, 2.6], "am_michael": [36.9, 2.59]}}, {"id": "L000014", "t_start": 41.856, "t_end": 44.576, "play_at": 48.61, "delay": 4.03, "text": "Delgado will be thinking about that one for a while.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [37.53, 2.71], "am_adam": [38.3, 2.62], "af_bella": [39.31, 2.83], "am_michael": [39.74, 2.78]}}, {"id": "L000015", "t_start": 45.12, "t_end": 48.576, "play_at": 52.703, "delay": 4.13, "text": "Brennan with the long ball forward, headed away by the center back.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [40.49, 3.43], "am_adam": [41.17, 3.58], "af_bella": [42.39, 3.7], "am_michael": [42.77, 3.91]}}, {"id": "L000016", "t_start": 49.152, "t_end": 54.208, "play_at": 59.456, "delay": 5.25, "text": "It drops to Okafor on the edge of the area, and he shoots. Straight at the keeper, you should have done better.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [44.17, 4.44], "am_adam": [45.0, 5.15], "af_bella": [46.34, 5.58], "am_michael": [46.93, 5.57]}}, {"id": "L000017", "t_start": 54.848, "t_end": 57.504, "play_at": 63.563, "delay": 4.47, "text": "Northgate keep the ball now, passing it around the back.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [48.86, 2.79], "am_adam": [50.4, 2.83], "af_bella": [52.17, 2.98], "am_michael": [52.75, 3.04]}}, {"id": "L000018", "t_start": 58.368, "t_end": 60.64, "play_at": 66.069, "delay": 3.98, "text": "20 minutes gone, and it is still 0-0.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [51.9, 2.69], "am_adam": [53.48, 2.59], "af_bella": [55.4, 2.67], "am_michael": [56.04, 2.62]}}, {"id": "L000019", "t_start": 61.152, "t_end": 63.104, "play_at": 68.47, "delay": 3.83, "text": "Moreau into the middle, now Tanaka again.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [54.84, 2.38], "am_adam": [56.32, 2.19], "af_bella": [58.32, 2.3], "am_michael": [58.91, 2.43]}}, {"id": "L000020", "t_start": 63.616, "t_end": 65.984, "play_at": 70.69, "delay": 3.78, "text": "Tanaka through on goal. He goes around the keeper.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [57.47, 2.71], "am_adam": [58.76, 2.71], "af_bella": [60.87, 2.77], "am_michael": [61.59, 2.85]}}, {"id": "L000021", "t_start": 66.112, "t_end": 68.832, "play_at": 73.291, "delay": 3.52, "text": "Go, go. Tanaka scores for Northgate United.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "peak", "seg": {"bm_george": [60.43, 2.12], "am_adam": [61.72, 2.49], "af_bella": [63.89, 2.7], "am_michael": [64.69, 2.54]}}, {"id": "L000022", "t_start": 69.76, "t_end": 69.888, "play_at": 75.343, "delay": 2.71, "text": "And the-", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "peak", "seg": {"bm_george": [62.8, 0.59], "am_adam": [64.46, 0.6], "af_bella": [66.84, 0.49], "am_michael": [67.48, 0.6]}}, {"id": "L000023", "t_start": 69.888, "t_end": 75.52, "play_at": 82.016, "delay": 6.5, "text": "Unbelievable. What a finish from Tanaka. Look at the pace, look at the car. You made that look so easy.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [63.64, 5.17], "am_adam": [65.31, 5.94], "af_bella": [67.58, 6.18], "am_michael": [68.33, 6.06]}}, {"id": "L000024", "t_start": 76.224, "t_end": 78.592, "play_at": 87.261, "delay": 3.95, "text": "So Northgate United lead by one goal to know.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [69.06, 2.7], "am_adam": [71.5, 2.64], "af_bella": [74.01, 2.53], "am_michael": [74.64, 2.69]}}, {"id": "L000025", "t_start": 79.264, "t_end": 82.784, "play_at": 89.689, "delay": 4.27, "text": "Riverside have to respond now, they can't let the aim drift.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [72.01, 3.2], "am_adam": [74.39, 3.24], "af_bella": [76.79, 3.32], "am_michael": [77.58, 3.44]}}, {"id": "L000026", "t_start": 83.36, "t_end": 87.136, "play_at": 92.586, "delay": 4.24, "text": "Lindqvist tries to lift his team, pointing for everyone to push up.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [75.46, 3.61], "am_adam": [77.88, 3.8], "af_bella": [80.36, 3.93], "am_michael": [81.27, 3.97]}}, {"id": "L000027", "t_start": 87.584, "t_end": 91.2, "play_at": 95.982, "delay": 4.78, "text": "A free kick on the right side for Riverside. This is a good area for Brennan.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [79.32, 4.19], "am_adam": [81.93, 4.38], "af_bella": [84.54, 4.61], "am_michael": [85.49, 4.57]}}, {"id": "L000028", "t_start": 91.776, "t_end": 94.688, "play_at": 99.952, "delay": 4.3, "text": "Brennan whips it in. Okafor rises in the far post.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [83.76, 3.0], "am_adam": [86.56, 3.15], "af_bella": [89.4, 3.09], "am_michael": [90.31, 3.29]}}, {"id": "L000029", "t_start": 94.976, "t_end": 95.168, "play_at": 102.745, "delay": 3.67, "text": "Dave.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [87.01, 0.57], "am_adam": [89.96, 0.55], "af_bella": [92.74, 0.49], "am_michael": [93.85, 0.57]}}, {"id": "L000030", "t_start": 95.168, "t_end": 96.768, "play_at": 103.321, "delay": 4.22, "text": "Save what is saved by the keeper.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "peak", "seg": {"bm_george": [87.83, 1.53], "am_adam": [90.76, 1.57], "af_bella": [93.48, 1.51], "am_michael": [94.67, 1.5]}}, {"id": "L000031", "t_start": 97.664, "t_end": 99.04, "play_at": 104.731, "delay": 3.43, "text": "That was right on the top for me.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [89.61, 1.52], "am_adam": [92.58, 1.45], "af_bella": [95.24, 1.39], "am_michael": [96.42, 1.46]}}, {"id": "L000032", "t_start": 99.2, "t_end": 100.736, "play_at": 106.093, "delay": 3.48, "text": "An incredible reaction stop.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [91.38, 1.61], "am_adam": [94.28, 1.59], "af_bella": [96.88, 1.47], "am_michael": [98.13, 1.56]}}, {"id": "L000033", "t_start": 101.568, "t_end": 104.448, "play_at": 108.262, "delay": 3.81, "text": "The corner comes to nothing and the game settles again.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [93.24, 2.89], "am_adam": [96.12, 3.05], "af_bella": [98.6, 3.01], "am_michael": [99.94, 3.11]}}, {"id": "L000034", "t_start": 105.12, "t_end": 107.968, "play_at": 111.991, "delay": 4.02, "text": "Northgate look happened to slow it down until the breath.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [96.38, 2.79], "am_adam": [99.42, 2.67], "af_bella": [101.86, 2.79], "am_michael": [103.3, 2.83]}}, {"id": "L000035", "t_start": 108.544, "t_end": 110.944, "play_at": 114.831, "delay": 3.89, "text": "Delgado wins a throw in near the corner flat.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [99.42, 2.75], "am_adam": [102.34, 2.55], "af_bella": [104.9, 2.74], "am_michael": [106.38, 2.7]}}, {"id": "L000036", "t_start": 111.52, "t_end": 114.464, "play_at": 118.687, "delay": 4.22, "text": "Quick throw into Mar. Clever play, they caught Riverside sleeping.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [102.42, 3.37], "am_adam": [105.14, 3.42], "af_bella": [107.89, 3.66], "am_michael": [109.33, 3.72]}}, {"id": "L000037", "t_start": 114.976, "t_end": 120.864, "play_at": 124.405, "delay": 3.54, "text": "Moreau shoots for range. Off the crossbar.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [106.04, 2.36], "am_adam": [108.81, 2.35], "af_bella": [111.8, 2.48], "am_michael": [113.3, 2.43]}}, {"id": "L000038", "t_start": 120.864, "t_end": 121.408, "play_at": 126.671, "delay": 3.29, "text": "That's it.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [108.65, 0.7], "am_adam": [111.41, 0.69], "af_bella": [114.53, 0.64], "am_michael": [115.98, 0.7]}}, {"id": "L000039", "t_start": 122.144, "t_end": 124.736, "play_at": 128.47, "delay": 3.73, "text": "The referee checks his watch almost half time here.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [109.6, 2.76], "am_adam": [112.35, 2.58], "af_bella": [115.42, 2.74], "am_michael": [116.93, 2.73]}}, {"id": "L000040", "t_start": 125.44, "t_end": 128.8, "play_at": 132.944, "delay": 4.14, "text": "A fair score so far, but the extension still to play for.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [112.61, 3.28], "am_adam": [115.18, 3.15], "af_bella": [118.41, 3.48], "am_michael": [119.91, 3.39]}}, {"id": "L000041", "t_start": 129.216, "t_end": 132.736, "play_at": 136.9, "delay": 4.16, "text": "One last attack before the break, Lindqvist carries it forward.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [116.14, 3.35], "am_adam": [118.58, 3.59], "af_bella": [122.14, 3.71], "am_michael": [123.55, 3.75]}}, {"id": "L000042", "t_start": 133.216, "t_end": 136.192, "play_at": 140.214, "delay": 4.02, "text": "He has Okafor on his left and Brennan arriving late.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [119.74, 3.01], "am_adam": [122.42, 2.89], "af_bella": [126.1, 3.05], "am_michael": [127.55, 3.04]}}, {"id": "L000043", "t_start": 136.672, "t_end": 140.128, "play_at": 144.587, "delay": 4.46, "text": "Lindqvist slips it through to Okafor. Okafor takes a touch and shoots.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [123.0, 3.54], "am_adam": [125.56, 3.73], "af_bella": [129.4, 3.88], "am_michael": [130.84, 3.89]}}, {"id": "L000044", "t_start": 140.32, "t_end": 140.736, "play_at": 147.951, "delay": 3.56, "text": "Go Go!", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "peak", "seg": {"bm_george": [126.79, 0.64], "am_adam": [129.54, 0.63], "af_bella": [133.53, 0.55], "am_michael": [134.98, 0.63]}}, {"id": "L000046", "t_start": 141.568, "t_end": 141.856, "play_at": 148.587, "delay": 4.93, "text": "Bell.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [127.68, 0.55], "am_adam": [130.42, 0.52], "af_bella": [134.33, 0.42], "am_michael": [135.86, 0.53]}}, {"id": "L000047", "t_start": 141.856, "t_end": 144.48, "play_at": 149.26, "delay": 4.78, "text": "Okafor utilizes for Riverside Rovers.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [128.48, 2.39], "am_adam": [131.19, 2.36], "af_bella": [135.0, 2.39], "am_michael": [136.64, 2.46]}}, {"id": "L000048", "t_start": 145.376, "t_end": 150.72, "play_at": 156.619, "delay": 5.9, "text": "What a time to score, right on the stroke of half time. That is exactly what Riverside needed.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [131.12, 4.27], "am_adam": [133.8, 4.94], "af_bella": [137.64, 5.35], "am_michael": [139.35, 5.19]}}, {"id": "L000049", "t_start": 150.72, "t_end": 151.808, "play_at": 161.017, "delay": 4.1, "text": "And the fans know it.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "excited", "seg": {"bm_george": [135.64, 1.24], "am_adam": [138.99, 1.14], "af_bella": [143.24, 1.0], "am_michael": [144.79, 1.17]}}, {"id": "L000050", "t_start": 152.576, "t_end": 154.432, "play_at": 162.088, "delay": 4.09, "text": "So it is one all here at Riverside Park.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [137.13, 2.5], "am_adam": [140.38, 2.08], "af_bella": [144.49, 2.02], "am_michael": [146.21, 2.23]}}, {"id": "L000051", "t_start": 155.072, "t_end": 158.112, "play_at": 164.342, "delay": 4.13, "text": "Both managers will have plenty to play in the dressing room.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [139.88, 3.06], "am_adam": [142.71, 2.86], "af_bella": [146.76, 3.1], "am_michael": [148.69, 3.0]}}, {"id": "L000052", "t_start": 158.72, "t_end": 161.568, "play_at": 166.909, "delay": 4.18, "text": "Northgate kick off again, but there is barely a minute left.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [143.19, 3.14], "am_adam": [145.82, 3.25], "af_bella": [150.11, 3.35], "am_michael": [151.94, 3.32]}}, {"id": "L000053", "t_start": 162.24, "t_end": 165.056, "play_at": 169.818, "delay": 3.88, "text": "I expect they will just play it safe until you whistle.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [146.58, 2.74], "am_adam": [149.32, 2.55], "af_bella": [153.71, 2.66], "am_michael": [155.51, 2.89]}}, {"id": "L000054", "t_start": 165.536, "t_end": 168.704, "play_at": 173.309, "delay": 4.6, "text": "Moreau passes it square to Delgado. No risks now, keep the ball.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [149.57, 3.6], "am_adam": [152.12, 3.65], "af_bella": [156.62, 3.93], "am_michael": [158.65, 3.81]}}, {"id": "L000055", "t_start": 169.28, "t_end": 171.68, "play_at": 176.738, "delay": 4.17, "text": "And there is the whistle for the end of the first half.", "speaker": "S1", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [153.42, 2.73], "am_adam": [156.02, 2.44], "af_bella": [160.8, 2.58], "am_michael": [162.71, 2.55]}}, {"id": "L000056", "t_start": 172.224, "t_end": 175.968, "play_at": 180.453, "delay": 4.49, "text": "A thrilling first half, one goal each, and so much still to come.", "speaker": "S2", "emotion": "neutral", "seg": {"bm_george": [156.4, 3.58], "am_adam": [158.71, 3.49], "af_bella": [163.63, 3.84], "am_michael": [165.51, 3.57]}}], "speakers": [{"id": "S1", "name": "Commentator 1", "color": "#4FA3FF", "default": "bm_george"}, {"id": "S2", "name": "Commentator 2", "color": "#F5A524", "default": "am_adam"}]}